":false},"body":"This PR adds a new editor setting: text_editor/appearance/lines/collapse_regions_on_start (default: false).\r\nWhen enabled, it automatically collapses all code regions the first time a script is opened in the current editor session.\r\n\r\nAI Use:\r\nI used AI for the code in editor/script/script_editor_plugin.cpp. Everything else was written by me.\r\n\r\nReasoning:\r\nThis setting improves workspace organization for projects using large scripts with multiple #region blocks. While regions help group code, they can lead to visual clutter when a script is reopened after some time. Auto-collapsing them ensures a clean, \"top-down\" view of the script's structure every time a developer returns to it, allowing them to expand only what is currently relevant.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://